  "body": "An impressive two-storey home offering generous living space, three bedrooms and two bathrooms. Well maintained and in great condition, this property is an excellent opportunity for anyone looking to relocate a substantial home onto their site.\r\n\r\n- 3 bedrooms\r\n- 2 bathrooms\r\n- Two-storey design\r\n- Generous living space\r\n- Aluminium joinery\r\n- Great condition throughout\r\n\r\nPRICE INCLUDES:\r\n\r\n- Purchase of the house\r\n- Preparation for relocation\r\n- Upper storey craned off for transport\r\n- Transportation to your site\r\n- Upper storey craned back into position\r\n- New foundations to NZS 3604 standards\r\n- House positioned and secured on foundations\r\n\r\nALL INCLUDED FOR $220,000 – CONDITIONS APPLY*\r\n\r\n*Final pricing is subject to delivery location, site access, ground conditions and any additional site-specific requirements.\r\n\r\nAn excellent opportunity to secure a quality two-storey home with relocation and foundation work included.\r\n\r\nViewing is strictly by appointment. Please contact us via email to arrange a private viewing at a time that suits you.",
